@startuml 05_state_servo
title Servo (diverter) state machine\n(src/sorter/servo_sorter/servo_sorter.cpp)
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #DAE8FC
  BorderColor #6C8EBF
}

[*] --> INIT : constructed
INIT --> IDLE : init(): driver begin(),\npark at 30 degrees\n(same angle as BIN2)
IDLE --> MOVING : moveTo(bin)\nbin is NONE -> ERROR_BIN (BIN1, 0 degrees)
MOVING --> IDLE : writeAngle(0, angle) done

note right of MOVING
  Angle per bin:
  BIN1 = 0, BIN2 = 30, BIN3 = 60 degrees.
  The servo has no feedback: the angle is
  trusted, not measured.
end note
@enduml
